{"version":1,"key":"card:88","content":{"id":88,"content":[{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"背景"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"今天我突然想开一个新的账户，专门用来写一些电子书，在通过电子邮箱创建了另一个账户之后，第一件事就是为这个账户添加一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"ssh","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的公钥，这样就不用每次提交都要输入密码了，但是当我试图直接将我电脑上的公钥提交时，它提示我这个公钥已经存在，这是我另一个 Github 账户使用的公钥，这使我意识到不同的账户不能使用相同的公钥。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解决办法"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先需要为新账号生成新的公钥和私钥"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"ssh-keygen -t rsa -f ~/.ssh/id_rsa_bookonly -C \"youremail\"","language":"bash","uuid":"42bcdb51-1817-4940-91cd-7564a2fa337e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"然后就可以在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":".ssh","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 文件夹中看到生成的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"id_rsa_bookonly","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"id_rsa_bookonly.pub","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 文件，现在我们将 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"id_rsa_bookonly.pub","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的文件内容添加到创建的 Github 账户中。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"添加完之后需要编辑 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"~/.ssh/config","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 文件，添加以下配置："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"Host book.github.com\n  HostName github.com\n  IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_rsa_book","language":"","uuid":"d2491f83-7ff7-4287-ab59-3a8d2e1835fa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"配置文件还是很容易看懂的，它的 Host 设置为了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"book.github.com","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以使用第二个账号下载和上传仓库的时候写法要进行改变"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"git clone git@github.com/User/Repo -> git clone git@book.github.com/User/Repo\ngit remote add origin git@github.com/User/Repo -> git remote add origin git@book.github.com/User/Repo","language":"bash","uuid":"8beade9e-11de-4d9e-a48a-047bf1b21fc5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["Github/技巧","技巧/Github"],"createTime":1689173634706,"updateTime":1752924215620,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1752924215620}}